    {
      "Id": "6c16092d5d85b981697e90b2850361fb",
      "Text": "WHAT IT DOES: finds the items whose Element > Level equals the text, then writes them to an IFC4 file with the project, site, building and storey names and the base point wired into Export.ToIfc. TO CHANGE: the level text, the names, the base point (Export.IfcCoordinates) and the file path.",
